      "source": [
        "# Storage Mapper — Missing Tank Pilot (Colab GPU · DOTA Aerial OBB)\n",
        "\n",
        "Uses an open aerial/satellite model (**YOLO26-OBB / YOLO11-OBB**, pretrained on DOTA where `storage tank` is a native top-down class). Everything runs remotely in Colab — nothing is downloaded locally.\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Select **Runtime -> Change runtime type -> T4 GPU** (free tier).\n",
        "2. Click **Runtime -> Run all**.\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Green circles:** Already mapped on OpenStreetMap\n",
        "- **Red dashed circles:** Unmapped tank candidates detected by the aerial model\n",
        "- **Fast re-tuning:** Tiles stay cached in Colab RAM, so after the first run you can adjust `CONF_THRESH` in Cell 1 and re-run only Cells 1, 4, and 5."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "cellView": "form"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "#@title 1. Pilot Settings\n",
        "MODEL_NAME = \"yolo26x-obb.pt\" #@param [\"yolo26x-obb.pt\", \"yolo11x-obb.pt\", \"yolo26l-obb.pt\", \"yolo11l-obb.pt\"]\n",
        "COUNTRY_ISO2 = \"IQ\" #@param [\"IQ\", \"SY\", \"IR\", \"TR\", \"KW\", \"SA\", \"JO\", \"AE\"]\n",
        "PILOT_LIMIT = 5 #@param {type:\"integer\"}\n",
        "MIN_FARM_TANKS = 4 #@param {type:\"integer\"}\n",
        "MAX_FARM_TANKS = 25 #@param {type:\"integer\"}\n",
        "CONF_THRESH = 0.35 #@param {type:\"slider\", min:0.15, max:0.85, step:0.05}\n",
        "ZOOM = 18 #@param [17, 18] {type:\"raw\"}\n",
        "BUFFER_M = 200 #@param {type:\"integer\"}\n",
        "MAX_TILES_PER_FARM = 100 #@param {type:\"integer\"}\n",
        "DOWNLOAD_GEOJSON = False #@param {type:\"boolean\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "print(f\"Config ready -> model={MODEL_NAME} | country={COUNTRY_ISO2} | pilot_farms={PILOT_LIMIT} | conf={CONF_THRESH} | zoom={ZOOM}\")\n"
      ]
    },
